---
// Section 14: "Why Stay Here?" Editorial Promise Panel
---

<section class="statement-section" id="promise">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="statement-wrap reveal">
      <div class="statement-copy">
        <div class="story-marker">Guest Promise</div>
        <h3 class="statement-title">What should a guest feel before booking with us?</h3>
        
        <p class="statement-quote">
          “This looks clean, trustworthy, easy, connected to Varanasi, and comfortable for my trip.”
        </p>

        <p class="statement-sub">
          We believe in honest hospitality. When you choose Thakur Ji, you know exactly what awaits: clean spaces, quiet nights, dependable air conditioning, and hosts who care about making your Varanasi journey memorable.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reasons-grid">
        <div class="reason-card">
          <span class="reason-num">01</span>
          <b>Honest Expectations</b>
          <p>You clearly understand the kind of stay this is — authentic, clean, and welcoming without artificial claims.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reason-card">
          <span class="reason-num">02</span>
          <b>Real Comfortable Rooms</b>
          <p>What you see in our photography is exactly what you get when you step through our door.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reason-card">
          <span class="reason-num">03</span>
          <b>Rooted in Varanasi</b>
          <p>Close enough to feel the sacred rhythm of Kashi, quiet enough to let you recharge deeply.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reason-card">
          <span class="reason-num">04</span>
          <b>Clear Communication</b>
          <p>Contact details and stay information are easy to understand when you need them.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.statement-section {
  padding: 40px 0 110px;
}

.statement-wrap {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff7eb 0%, #fbf1e0 100%);
  border: 1px solid rgba(185, 137, 63, 0.22);
  border-radius: 32px;
  padding: 44px 48px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
  gap: 40px;
  box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(47, 23, 16, 0.1);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  isolation: isolate;
}

.statement-wrap::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  right: -80px;
  bottom: -80px;
  width: 260px;
  height: 260px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(233, 198, 129, 0.22), transparent 70%);
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: -1;
}

.statement-title {
  margin: 6px 0 16px;
  font: 600 42px / 1.05 var(--font-serif);
  color: #5d1118;
  letter-spacing: -0.5px;
}

.statement-quote {
  font: 500 24px / 1.35 var(--font-serif);
  color: #8c5d26;
  font-style: italic;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
  padding-left: 18px;
  border-left: 2px solid #b9893f;
}

.statement-sub {
  color: var(--soft);
  font-size: 13.5px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin: 0;
}

.reasons-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 14px;
}

.reason-card {
  background: rgba(255, 252, 247, 0.85);
  border: 1px solid rgba(145, 101, 65, 0.14);
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 18px 20px;
  transition: transform 0.25s, border-color 0.25s;
}

.reason-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  border-color: #b9893f;
}

.reason-num {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #b9893f;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.reason-card b {
  display: block;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #52151c;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.reason-card p {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #725b52;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .statement-wrap {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    padding: 34px;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 680px) {
  .statement-section {
    padding: 20px 0 80px;
  }
  .statement-wrap {
    padding: 24px;
    border-radius: 24px;
  }
  .statement-title {
    font-size: 32px;
  }
  .statement-quote {
    font-size: 20px;
  }
  .reasons-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
